      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} sorry about the late reply, went to sleep shortly after posting this canny. I assume you just want a list of triggers involved in starting the boss fight? if this helps:\n\nthe boss is started with an on interact button:\n-----\nOn interact- always unbuffered\n-----\nActions: \nActivate custom trigger:  boss start\n---------------------------------------------\n\n\nthis calls the following custom trigger:\n-----\ncustom trigger (boss start) - Local\n-----\nActions: \nAnimation trigger (start): 2 animators in receivers  \nAnimation trigger (Active): 1 animator\nSet game object active: 1 audio source object\nAnimation Int (HP) : 1 animator\nAnimation trigger (reset): 1 animator\n------------------------------------------------\n\nThe weakpoint animator is part of the 1st action in the custom trigger (one of the 2 animators in the receiver). The weakpoints are always active/enabled in the scene but the animation controls the mesh renderer and collider components.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
