      "value": "in my world something similar happens, I have a ui where it sends events to the triggers, but they have stopped working, only those that are not in the same object work, the id of the world is wrld_fae3fa95-bc18-46f0-af57-f0c97c0ca90a, can see that the curtains do not execute any trigger, but if events are sent in the graphic options, because the trigger is not in the same object. \nhttps://gyazo.com/507996dfdc35b9aa57d7c5a9837d6510",
