      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi, I am having the same issue. After updating, my trigger only fire some of the actions but not all. I have not changed anything t all since the last time I updated the map. All triggers are local and are either onentertrigger or oninteract. everything works fine when simulating the parameter in play mode. my world id is wrld_20052280-32ef-4d5d-b2e8-8e081f2d58c8. There is an ui menu on the left side of spawn. All the sliders and button work but the \"Potato Mode\" button which should disable rocks, animators of the Castle on the hill and butterflies at spawn. At spawn there is also a trigger that would fire once the player enter to change the spawn point from the initial (the black box with a door) to in front of the small house.",
      "viewerReactions": null
